{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24828","headline":"仪凤 · 杨嗣复","name":"仪凤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八方该帝泽，威凤忽来宾。\n向日朱光动，迎风翠羽新。\n低昂多异趣，饮啄迥无邻。\n郊薮今翔集，河图意等伦。\n闻韶知鼓舞，偶圣愿逡巡。\n比屋初同俗，垂恩击壤人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨嗣复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}